{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44945","headline":"冬日遥和卢使君幼平綦毋居士游法华寺高顶临湖亭 · 皎然","name":"冬日遥和卢使君幼平綦毋居士游法华寺高顶临湖亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仁坊标绝境，廉守蹑高踪。\n天晓才分刹，风传欲尽钟。\n城中归路远，湖上碧山重。\n水照千花界，云开七叶峰。\n寒芳艾绶满，空翠白纶浓。\n逸韵知难继，佳游恨不逢。\n仍闻抚禅石，爲我久从容。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44945.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44945","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}